# Test Imports and Authoring Rule

1. Tests under `tests/**` MUST import testing symbols ONLY from `ui_test_platform.fixtures.pom.test_options`:
   ```python
   from ui_test_platform.fixtures.pom.test_options import AppConfig, Page, Platform, Tag, expect, step, tags, title
   ```
2. Direct imports from `playwright.sync_api` and `pytest_playwright` in `tests/**` are banned and rejected by Ruff rule `TID251`.
3. Tests must be thin and delegate all DOM interactions to Page Objects provided via fixtures.
4. Type-only imports must be placed under `if TYPE_CHECKING:`.
